.git
.gitignore
node_modules
**/node_modules
.pnpm-store
web/dist
**/dist
internal/web/dist/*
!internal/web/dist/
!internal/web/dist/index.html
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
.smoke-data
/cpa/
oh-my-cpa-data
caddy-data
caddy-config

# A developer's own environment file, if one exists locally: it carries their master
# key and their CPA credentials, and nothing in an image needs it. The server reads
# configuration from the environment, which the platform supplies.
.env
# Test and browser-acceptance output. It is hundreds of megabytes of screenshots and
# traces, none of which is build input, and every byte of it has to be uploaded to a
# remote builder before the build can start.
tmp
# Agent session state, for the same reason.
.pi
